      <atom:link href="https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/22/arts/music/bernie-taupin-album-sea-has-no-mercy.html" rel="standout"></atom:link>
      <description>Known for writing the lyrics to Elton John’s melodies, Taupin said creating both — and singing — on his first solo album in nearly 40 years felt “completely selfish in just the right way.”</description>
